{"title":"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 12","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(CREATIVE_THINKING)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A magazine printed photos of three celebrities along with three photos of the celebrities as babies. The baby pictures did not identify the celebrities. Readers were asked to match each celebrity with the correct baby pictures. What is the probability that a reader guessing at random will match all three correctly? \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/b/c7b58bee223ef149a87b017686845cc450103784.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }\\frac{1}{9}\\qquad\\textbf{(B) }\\frac{1}{6}\\qquad\\textbf{(C) }\\frac{1}{4}\\qquad\\textbf{(D) }\\frac{1}{3}\\qquad\\textbf{(E) }\\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"371\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For the first celebrity, you have a 1/3 chance of picking the photo. Given you get the picture right, you now have a 1/2 chance of picking the next photo. If you get both of them right, you are guaranteed to get the third right. Thus the probability is 1/2*1/3 which is 1/6.\n-JasonDaGoat\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let's call the celebrities A, B, and C. \nThere is a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/1/4e1965f8d70832ded66434c75a7bd52b75090af0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" /> chance that celebrity A's picture will be selected, and a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/1/4e1965f8d70832ded66434c75a7bd52b75090af0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" /> chance that his baby picture will be selected. That means there are two celebrities left. There is now a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/9/2f960094315d60883495f9b74148e17487ee9584.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" /> chance that celebrity B's picture will be selected, and another <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/9/2f960094315d60883495f9b74148e17487ee9584.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" /> chance that his baby picture will be selected. This leaves a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/0/4c0f3c3dc90548f3c3310547ace4cecd40a7150c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"11\" height=\"37\" /> chance for the last celebrity, so the total probability is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/f/18fa26fe9e520aa044af0601bc1a1a65f410529e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{3}\\cdot \\frac{1}{3}\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}=\\frac{1}{36}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"136\" height=\"37\" />. However, the order of the celebrities doesn't matter, so the final probability will be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/d/a8d7945b8d88ecc4b93ceda6fe9418cc6e59d096.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3!\\cdot \\frac{1}{36}=\\boxed{\\text{(B) }\\dfrac{1}{6}}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"135\" height=\"49\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>There is a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/1/4e1965f8d70832ded66434c75a7bd52b75090af0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" /> chance that the reader will choose the correct baby picture for the first person. Next, the second person gives a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/9/2f960094315d60883495f9b74148e17487ee9584.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" /> chance, and the last person leaves only 1 choice. Thus, the probability is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/0/90001193a05a1a0360e1a56e046dad91b73550a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{1}{3\\cdot 2}=\\boxed{\\text{(B) }\\dfrac{1}{6}}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"117\" height=\"48\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>There are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/5/6859713adc973d3fbe97fafef9ce829757e54b12.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3!$\" width=\"12\" height=\"13\" /> ways assign the pictures to each of the celebrities. There is one favorable outcome where all of them are matched correctly, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/f/44f5f6760df0f0a9ed285ea69f8b21f0ae718d1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}~\\frac{1}{6}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"58\" height=\"48\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28CREATIVE_THINKING.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(CREATIVE_THINKING)\">Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/2SyV2oO_fOU\">https://youtu.be/2SyV2oO_fOU</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/zoyYtCF4waw\">https://youtu.be/zoyYtCF4waw</a> ~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8\" title=\"2014 AMC 8\">2014 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2014\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 11\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 13\">Problem 13</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wi